
== Analytics

The Analytics tab provides visibility into the replication activity of the current node. Reports are prepared by the *Refresh Analytics* job, which runs every 6 hours by default.

Each report screen contains an info bar that shows when the report data was last refreshed and how often the *Refresh Analytics* job is scheduled to run.
Use the *Run Now* button to trigger the job immediately.
The *Data retained for* link shows how many days of data are kept and opens a dialog to edit the `purge.stats.retention.minutes` parameter.

